@startuml
participant Composition
participant Hub
participant TapSlot
participant Provider
Composition -> Hub: reserve(item, route binding)
Hub -> TapSlot: validate filters and lossless capacity
Hub --> Composition: reservation/result
Composition -> Provider: submit(item)
Provider --> Composition: outcome
Composition -> Hub: commit(reservation, item, outcome)
Hub -> TapSlot: copy normalized record or apply best-effort policy
Hub --> Composition: counters/validity status
@enduml
